      "body": "## Purpose\n\nThe shm tensor arena (`--enable-shm-tensor-arena`) has a fixed slot count and slot size. With large images at high concurrency, requests exceed the arena and fall back to the slow path (pickled tensors): we counted 1,300+ fallbacks in one 8-row image sweep. This adds `--shm-tensor-arena-slots` and `--shm-tensor-arena-slot-mb` (defaults = today's values) so deployments can size the arena for their traffic.\n\nOpen question for maintainers: whether you prefer these knobs or a structural fix (arena that grows, or slot sizing from the model's max mm payload).\n\n## Test Plan\n\n- Unit test for the option plumbing and defaults.\n\n## Test Result\n\nMiniMax-M3 VL (image) on MI355X, TP2, 8-row image sweep, 128 slots x 48 MB vs default (A B B A): arena fallbacks 1,300+ → 0, TTFT **+9.1%** better, output throughput +0.2% (neutral).\n",
      "changedFiles": 6,
